# Trivy's copy of the zip 3.0.0 triage in deny.toml (RUSTSEC-2026-0367/0368/0369/0429/0545/0548).
# zip 3.0.0 is a BUILD-dependency only, of utoipa-swagger-ui 9's build script, which unpacks one
# pinned Swagger UI release archive at compile time; nothing here extracts an archive at runtime,
# and every one of these needs a hostile archive. Remove these with the utoipa-swagger-ui 10
# (zip ^9) upgrade, together with the deny.toml entries.
CVE-2026-115905
CVE-2026-115909

# libssl3 3.0.20 in gcr.io/distroless/base-debian12:nonroot (container-build's image scan):
# DTLS handshake retransmission info disclosure, fixed in Debian's 3.0.22 but not yet in a
# distroless rebuild. No binary here loads OpenSSL (no openssl-sys anywhere in the workspace;
# TLS is rustls), and nothing speaks DTLS, so the library is present but never used. Expires so
# the scan re-checks once distroless has had time to pick up the fix.
CVE-2026-84782 exp:2026-12-21
